  "worked_solution": "The asymptotes of $y=\\operatorname{tan}\u2061x$ are given by the following expression:\n\n$$\nx={90}^{\u2218}+n\\cdot {180}^{\u2218}\n$$\n\nTo find the asymptotes of $\\operatorname{tan}\u2061(2x)-2,$ we replace the $x$ on the left-hand side of the above with $(2x).$ This gives:\n\n$$\n2x={90}^{\u2218}+n\\cdot {180}^{\u2218}\n$$\n\nSolving this for $x$ gives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={45}^{\u2218}+n\\cdot {90}^{\u2218}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
